{"overview":"در دنیایی که فقط جادوگران می‌توانند جادو کنند، باید هنگام جادو کردن از دیده شدن توسط مردم عادی اجتناب کنند. در حالی که کوکو کارهای خانه‌اش را انجام می‌دهد، رویای جادوگر شدن را در سر می‌پروراند. وقتی جادوگر جوانی به نام قِفری از روستای او بازدید می‌کند، کوکو «راز مطلق» را کشف می‌کند، شاگرد قِفری می‌شود و تحصیلاتش را آغاز می‌کند. این داستان کودکانی است که با ناامیدی روبرو می‌شوند، اما به سوی امید دست دراز می‌کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"In a world where only witches can cast magic, they must avoid being seen by ordinary people while casting. While Coco does her chores, she daydreams of becoming a witch. When a young witch named Qifrey visits her village, Coco uncovers the “absolute secret,” becomes Qifrey’s apprentice, and begins her studies. This is the story of children who encounter despair, yet reach out toward hope.","tagline_en":"No one can ever know — the witch's absolute secret.","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":13,"y":2026,"poster":"/1qGSBnrANHLX8C7KqGuPDCylns2.jpg"}],"episodes":13,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"本村玲奈","role":"Coco (voice)","photo":"/cI7dsdfqW6hs4bbzhaQrKEcjtU4.jpg","en":"Rena Motomura"},{"name":"花江夏樹","role":"Qifrey (voice)","photo":"/alTb0DlcPIbcwM08WSmxFai58sd.jpg","en":"Natsuki Hanae"},{"name":"山村響","role":"Agott (voice)","photo":"/7mZ02XdjbbO0AnsX5Fwr23ZFe3G.jpg","en":"Hibiku Yamamura"},{"name":"陽木くるみ","role":"Tetia (voice)","photo":"/qmiDVDmKd7JWhsJAu0QLlpTV9l4.jpg","en":"Kurumi Haruki"},{"name":"月城日花","role":"Richeh (voice)","photo":"/iJU59ru8Rv9sIHd5kMznFDZktZr.jpg","en":"Hika Tsukishiro"}],"trailer":"E10fd3B8hUw","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/196950/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n